  "description": "Thoughts on the next 10 years in the Stock Market",
  "body_html": "<p>This video was in response to the article released today: <a href=\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/money/2025/08/03/stock-market-forecast-recession-sp500-magnificent-seven/85472481007/\">Forecasts predict a dismal decade for stocks, here’s what to do.</a> This is how I envision the next 10 years in the stock market. And please be aware…I do NOT have a crystal balls. Your speculation could be right. Additionally, in respect of time, I kept the millions of variables involved in these topics very broad. I am sure you are thinking of something that I did not include. </p><p>Overall though, my general expectation is we finish off this blow off top (I am fairly convinced we have entered that stage, though we will not know for sure until in hindsight). Then we start a prolonged down trend…referring to my large scale market drop. But overall, in the next <em><strong>decade </strong></em>I think the market will have a recovery. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Faxm!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08dc39a9-ebb9-4699-a3e7-ef814fd8d0a6_1398x703.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Faxm!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08dc39a9-ebb9-4699-a3e7-ef814fd8d0a6_1398x703.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Faxm!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08dc39a9-ebb9-4699-a3e7-ef814fd8d0a6_1398x703.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Faxm!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08dc39a9-ebb9-4699-a3e7-ef814fd8d0a6_1398x703.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Faxm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08dc39a9-ebb9-4699-a3e7-ef814fd8d0a6_1398x703.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Faxm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08dc39a9-ebb9-4699-a3e7-ef814fd8d0a6_1398x703.png\" width=\"1398\" height=\"703\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/08dc39a9-ebb9-4699-a3e7-ef814fd8d0a6_1398x703.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:703,&quot;width&quot;:1398,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:131135,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/170080155?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08dc39a9-ebb9-4699-a3e7-ef814fd8d0a6_1398x703.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Faxm!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08dc39a9-ebb9-4699-a3e7-ef814fd8d0a6_1398x703.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Faxm!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08dc39a9-ebb9-4699-a3e7-ef814fd8d0a6_1398x703.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Faxm!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08dc39a9-ebb9-4699-a3e7-ef814fd8d0a6_1398x703.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Faxm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08dc39a9-ebb9-4699-a3e7-ef814fd8d0a6_1398x703.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">There have been several videos detailing the “why”. But my forecasts point towards a large scale macro correction. Followed by a multi-year bull market. This is not drawn to scale….but what I somewhat have envisioned in my mind. Note, you can have a good few months or year, in a macro down trend…and you can have a bad few months or year in a macro up trend. </figcaption></figure></div><p>I also speculate that the bottom will be somewhere around $30 a barrel for oil. Yes, this will be a short period of time U.S. Oil producers are not profitable. </p><p>Again…this is all speculation. My speculation is based on dozens of variables that I have presented the last few months. Constructive thoughts or feedback is always welcome. Speculating scenarios of the future is never a perfect game…but a game that must be played to be successful over time in the markets. </p><p>As always if you have questions, feel free to ping me in the chat. Happy Monday! And thanks for stopping by!</p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://www.stocktokdashboard.com/\">StockTokDashboard</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a> </strong></em></p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
